{"id":"abc082d1b934e51b","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-cat-coproduct-object.md","title":"ZFC Cat Coproduct Object","display":"df-zfc-cat-coproduct-object — ZFC Cat Coproduct Object","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-cat-coproduct-object","aliases":["58-df-zfc-cat-coproduct-object"],"display":"df-zfc-cat-coproduct-object — ZFC Cat Coproduct Object","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-cat-coproduct-object"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-cat-coproduct-object</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-cat-coproduct-object — ZFC Cat Coproduct Object"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q,A,B,\\iota_A,\\iota_B,\\mathcal C,X,f,g,u\\in V\">\\(Q,A,B,\\iota_A,\\iota_B,\\mathcal C,X,f,g,u\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\langle O,M,s,t,\\circ,e\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\langle O,M,s,t,\\circ,e\\rangle\\)</span> is a category datum, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCatCoproductObject}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCatCoproductObject}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat\\text{-}coproduct\\text{-}object}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCatCoproductObject}_S(Q,A,B,\\iota_A,\\iota_B,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\exists O,M,s,t,\\circ,e\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\\langle O,M,s,t,\\circ,e\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land A,B,Q\\in O\\land\\iota_A,\\iota_B\\in M\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land s(\\iota_A)=A\\land t(\\iota_A)=Q\n\\land s(\\iota_B)=B\\land t(\\iota_B)=Q\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall X\\in O\\;\\forall f,g\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\ns(f)=A\\land t(f)=X\\land s(g)=B\\land t(g)=X\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{13em}\\to\\exists!u\\in M\\;\\bigl(\ns(u)=Q\\land t(u)=X\n\\land\\circ(\\langle u,\\iota_A\\rangle)=f\n\\land\\circ(\\langle u,\\iota_B\\rangle)=g\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat\\text{-}coproduct\\text{-}object}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCatCoproductObject}_S(Q,A,B,\\iota_A,\\iota_B,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\exists O,M,s,t,\\circ,e\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\\langle O,M,s,t,\\circ,e\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land A,B,Q\\in O\\land\\iota_A,\\iota_B\\in M\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land s(\\iota_A)=A\\land t(\\iota_A)=Q\n\\land s(\\iota_B)=B\\land t(\\iota_B)=Q\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall X\\in O\\;\\forall f,g\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\ns(f)=A\\land t(f)=X\\land s(g)=B\\land t(g)=X\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{13em}\\to\\exists!u\\in M\\;\\bigl(\ns(u)=Q\\land t(u)=X\n\\land\\circ(\\langle u,\\iota_A\\rangle)=f\n\\land\\circ(\\langle u,\\iota_B\\rangle)=g\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The hom-classes are expressed through the source and target maps, and composition is application of the composition function to an ordered pair.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C=\\langle O,M,s,t,\\circ,e\\rangle$ is a category datum, and $\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch04/58-df-category.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"Q,A,B,\\iota_A,\\iota_B,\\mathcal C,X,f,g,u\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C=\\langle O,M,s,t,\\circ,e\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCatCoproductObject}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat\\text{-}coproduct\\text{-}object}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCatCoproductObject}_S(Q,A,B,\\iota_A,\\iota_B,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\exists O,M,s,t,\\circ,e\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\\langle O,M,s,t,\\circ,e\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land A,B,Q\\in O\\land\\iota_A,\\iota_B\\in M\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land s(\\iota_A)=A\\land t(\\iota_A)=Q\n\\land s(\\iota_B)=B\\land t(\\iota_B)=Q\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall X\\in O\\;\\forall f,g\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\ns(f)=A\\land t(f)=X\\land s(g)=B\\land t(g)=X\\\\\n&\\hspace{13em}\\to\\exists!u\\in M\\;\\bigl(\ns(u)=Q\\land t(u)=X\n\\land\\circ(\\langle u,\\iota_A\\rangle)=f\n\\land\\circ(\\langle u,\\iota_B\\rangle)=g\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1521,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1558","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-cat-coproduct-object.md|58-df-zfc-cat-coproduct-object]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","a87b7e1119b63b2c"]}